{
    "id":  10886,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Street Light 100W AREA FLEX - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835",
    "reference":  "STOSR100W-WW-91928",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover the \u003cb\u003e100W AREA FLEX LED street light\u003c/b\u003e, made of high quality aluminum and powered by the powerful \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835 chip\u003c/strong\u003e, designed to provide exceptional illumination in outdoor\u003cstrong\u003e public lighting areas\u003c/strong\u003e. With its high brightness, it guarantees bright and effective illumination in any environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its versatile design and articulated arm, it allows easy orientation of the street light, adapting to the specific needs of each space. Illuminate your exteriors with quality and versatility with the LED Streetlight 100W AREA FLEX!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Street Light 100W AREA FLEX - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eAREA FLEX 100W LED street light\u003c/b\u003e, an exceptional solution to illuminate your outdoor spaces. Made of high quality aluminum and powered by the powerful \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM DURIS E 2835 chip\u003c/strong\u003e, this street light provides exceptional illumination for any outdoor environment. Its versatile design and articulated arm allows you to direct the light according to your specific needs, adapting perfectly to every situation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne of the great advantages of this lantern is its \u003cstrong\u003eextra-flat design\u003c/strong\u003e, which not only prevents the accumulation of dirt and leaves, but also minimizes their visual impact. With immediate start-up, it eliminates annoying waiting times, providing safety for pedestrians in case of power failure.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eManufactured with high quality aluminum, this lantern favors excellent heat dissipation, which prolongs its service life and reduces maintenance costs. In addition, its IP65 protection makes it resistant to weather changes without affecting its lighting performance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a wide beam angle, the AREA FLEX LED street light reaches a larger area with uniform and efficient illumination. Perfect for \u003cstrong\u003estreet lighting\u003c/strong\u003e, gardens, parks, sports centers and parking lots, this LED luminaire guarantees low power consumption and high performance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlexible Installation Options The AREA FLEX LED Street Light\u003c/strong\u003e offers three installation modes to suit any need:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDirect wall installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Easy and without additional accessories. Pole installation: Adaptable to any column with a tip diameter of 60mm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArm or bracket installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Perfect for mounting on arms adapted to columns or walls.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, its rotating base allows for adjusting the tilt up to 90°, ensuring personalized and precise lighting from any angle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of LED Street Light 100W AREA FLEX - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe uses and applications are varied and versatile, making it an ideal choice for a wide range of outdoor environments. Some of its main applications include:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1. Street Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e The AREA FLEX LED Streetlight is perfect for illuminating streets, avenues, roads and other public areas, providing efficient and safe lighting for pedestrians and drivers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2. Gardens and Paths:\u003c/strong\u003e This street light is ideal for illuminating gardens, parks and pathways, creating a welcoming and safe environment at night and improving visibility in landscaped areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3. Parks and Squares:\u003c/strong\u003e In urban parks and squares, the AREA FLEX LED Streetlight provides bright and uniform illumination that allows people to enjoy these outdoor spaces even after dark.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4. Sports facilities:\u003c/strong\u003e For outdoor sports areas, such as tennis courts, basketball courts or soccer fields, this street light provides the necessary light for sports practice during the night.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5. Parking lots:\u003c/strong\u003e In parking lots and parking areas, the AREA FLEX LED Streetlight ensures adequate illumination to improve safety and facilitate vehicle orientation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn summary, the AREA FLEX \u003cb\u003e100W \u003c/b\u003eLED \u003cstrong\u003eStreetlight\u003c/strong\u003e is a versatile and efficient solution for a variety of outdoor environments, providing quality lighting and contributing to the safety and comfort of people passing through these spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED, we ensure the quality of our products and provide all the necessary elements for their distribution, import or wholesale, including the technical data sheet of each LED product. Illuminate your outdoor spaces with quality and efficiency with the AREA FLEX 100W LED Streetlight!\u003c/p\u003e",
